Guys, as temporary fix you can change lines 46-84 (basically all after "--Recipe" line) in file modmain.lua (you can find it here "SteamInstallationPath\Steam\steamapps\workshop\content\322330\858801295") into these:
local recipeings = {Ingredient("heatrock",1),Ingredient("log",5),Ingredient("transistor",2)}
local config = {atlas = "images/inventoryimages/icemaker.xml",}
AddRecipe2("icemaker", recipeings, TECH.NONE, config)
AddRecipeToFilter("icemaker","STRUCTURES")
That way at least you can have fixed recipe (i can't figure out how to enable recipe changing).

@Saies
That's pretty weird, considering this mod doesn't adds anything network intensive, nor network related for that matter. It only adds a new item (which is practically a pinecone, except for the looks and the fact it grows marble trees) and a small to large animation, which only plays once. My friend has been running this mod in her server (along many others) and so far we all have good ping most of the time.
Have you tried testing out this mod alone? Might be due to food display (the seed itself is considered edible by creatures that eat rocks), but that is very unlikely. Or minimap (which may try for some reason to render the trees over and over again), again, very unlikely.

